- A user can register and log in.
- A user can create multiple workspaces.
- Workspace administrators can invite team members.
- Managers can create projects.
- Authorized members can create and update tasks.
- Tasks can be moved using drag and drop.
- Unauthorized users cannot access protected resources.
- Users can collaborate through comments.
- Relevant task updates appear in real time.
- Notifications are persisted.
- Analytics use actual database records.
- Calendar displays real deadlines.
- File uploads work.
- Backend tests pass.
- Frontend tests pass.
- Application works on mobile and desktop.
- Application is deployed and documented.

